    "Most clients notice meaningful change within 12 to 20 sessions. The early work often produces clarity about what has actually been happening internally that was previously difficult to name. Later sessions produce the structural shifts -- in how you relate to yourself, in how the anxiety operates, in how you show up in relationships -- that make the change lasting rather than temporary.",
