    "EMDR sessions for anxiety process the specific experiences that established performance anxiety and contingent self-worth systematically. The bilateral stimulation activates natural processing capacity that allows those stored experiences to integrate rather than continue organizing present reactions. For Palo Alto clients whose performance anxiety has clear experiential roots -- specific situations that calibrated the nervous system to respond with alarm to evaluation -- EMDR often produces significant relief within 8 to 16 sessions.",
